{
  "Name": "Christmas_Weaver",
  "$Comment": [
    "Elsie the Weaver's Christmas conversation, what she says once only Christmas runs and she stands",
    "beside Santa in her winter clothes (her placement's Christmas entry names it in Interact). While",
    "Harvest Feast's last days still run she speaks her feast conversation instead, whose Christmas lines",
    "reach her stall and her quest list (DialogueExtensions/SeasonsOfOrbis/Christmas_Weaver_Feast_Line.json).",
    "Elsie never contracts: I am, it is, do not.",
    "",
    "Start's First beats come first. The off-season beat answers a visit while Christmas is off (after a",
    "command ends it, or when a server owner stands Elsie somewhere all year) with one line and goodbye. A",
    "conversation has no Season leaf, so the off-season beat and the stall line read the feature",
    "ziggfreedcommon:feature Christmas_Live, Min 1, and nobody is sent to a stall that opens closed. Then",
    "the next step's pointer, once per player (OnceId christmas_elsie_next_santa): once her part of the",
    "story is collected and Christmas Eve is not taken yet, she sends the player back to Santa. Collecting",
    "her quest plays this conversation again (its CompletionDialogue), so the pointer comes straight after.",
    "",
    "Quests holds three rows, all bound to her by the id she keeps in both seasons (Harvest_Feast_Weaver).",
    "Her part of Santa's story, Wrapping Presents (christmas_wrapping_presents): the conversation opens on",
    "its offer while it can be taken, on its brief while it is carried, and on its hand-in once the fibre is",
    "in the bag and Bram has his present. Then her daily, Daily Wrapping (christmas_daily_wrapping), the",
    "same three screens. Then her secret's apprentice quest, Elsie's Apprentice (christmas_elsie_apprentice),",
    "the same three screens: it teaches the route that opens her Reindeer Suit on every server. Each hand-in",
    "opens her quest list with Collect in front of the player. Otherwise it opens on greeting, the Fallback:",
    "who she is this Christmas and what her stall sells, in plain words, with her stall, her quest list (Can",
    "I help?, which also lists the day's job from her own board, Boards/SeasonsOfOrbis/Christmas_Weaver_Jobs.json),",
    "what to do with a present (the presents screen), and why she is here. One more line shows only where MMO",
    "Skill Tree is installed (its Factor condition, hytale:mod_installed with Min 1): the other key to her",
    "secret, Building level 20, on the secret_skill screen. Its words, and the apprentice quest's, are in",
    "christmas.mmo.lang."
  ],
  "Start": {
    "First": [
      {
        "Node": "off_season",
        "When": [
          { "Type": "Not", "Of": [ { "Type": "Factor", "Factor": "ziggfreedcommon:feature", "Param": "Christmas_Live", "Min": 1 } ] }
        ]
      },
      {
        "Node": "next_santa",
        "When": [
          { "Type": "QuestState", "Quest": "christmas_wrapping_presents", "State": "COMPLETED" },
          { "Type": "QuestState", "Quest": "christmas_eve", "State": "NOT_STARTED" }
        ],
        "Once": true,
        "OnceId": "christmas_elsie_next_santa"
      }
    ],
    "Quests": {
      "christmas_wrapping_presents": { "Offerable": "wrapping_offer", "Active": "wrapping_brief", "Ready": "wrapping_ready" },
      "christmas_daily_wrapping": { "Offerable": "fibre_offer", "Active": "fibre_brief", "Ready": "fibre_ready" },
      "christmas_elsie_apprentice": { "Offerable": "apprentice_offer", "Active": "apprentice_brief", "Ready": "apprentice_ready" }
    },
    "Fallback": "greeting"
  },
  "Nodes": {
    "off_season": {
      "TextKey": "dialogue.christmas_weaver.off_season.text",
      "Options": [
        { "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_weaver.off_season.opt.farewell", "Style": "farewell", "Close": true }
      ]
    },
    "greeting": {
      "TextKey": "dialogue.christmas_weaver.greeting.text",
      "Options": [
        {
          "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_weaver.opt.stall",
          "Style": "neutral",
          "Conditions": [
            { "Type": "Factor", "Factor": "ziggfreedcommon:feature", "Param": "Christmas_Live", "Min": 1 }
          ],
          "Open": { "Type": "Shop", "Shop": "Christmas_Weaver" }
        },
        { "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_weaver.opt.quests", "Style": "neutral", "Open": "Quests" },
        { "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_weaver.opt.presents", "Style": "neutral", "Goto": "presents" },
        { "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_weaver.opt.why", "Style": "neutral", "Goto": "why" },
        {
          "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_weaver.opt.secret_skill",
          "Style": "neutral",
          "Conditions": [
            { "Type": "Factor", "Factor": "hytale:mod_installed", "Param": "Ziggfreed:MMOSkillTree", "Min": 1 }
          ],
          "Goto": "secret_skill"
        }
      ],
      "IncludeOptions": [ "goodbye" ]
    },
    "secret_skill": {
      "TextKey": "dialogue.christmas_weaver.secret_skill.text",
      "Options": [
        { "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_weaver.opt.back", "Style": "neutral", "Goto": "greeting" }
      ],
      "IncludeOptions": [ "goodbye" ]
    },
    "apprentice_offer": {
      "TextKey": "dialogue.christmas_weaver.apprentice_offer.text",
      "Options": [
        {
          "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_weaver.apprentice_offer.opt.accept",
          "Style": "accept",
          "Do": [ { "Accept": "christmas_elsie_apprentice" }, { "Goto": "apprentice_brief" } ]
        },
        { "LabelKey": "dialogue.christmas_weaver.opt.later", "Style": "neutral", "Goto": "greeting" }
      ],
      "IncludeOptions": [ "goodbye" ]
    },
    "apprentice_brief": {
